cept", "title": "Urinary tract infection, pyelonephritis, and urinary retention"}, {"id": "fe6737d1-9f46-4e0e-844c-240b8ed46afc", "type": "concept", "title": "Kidney stones and obstructive uropathy"}]}, {"id": "8d7f4abd-589e-4392-bc2d-2fa9b18f8c48", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Renal therapies and teaching", "description": "Students learn supportive care, safety, and patient education around renal treatment.", "children": [{"id": "54748e5a-aee6-42e4-9566-0377d38e9bd3", "type": "concept", "title": "Fluid and electrolyte management"}, {"id": "deb88125-e6b6-4187-bca0-1a40f125973f", "type": "concept", "title": "Dialysis concepts and vascular access precautions"}, {"id": "7940354c-1da3-4c00-a47f-776f9b12ff6f", "type": "concept", "title": "Diet, medication, and follow-up teaching"}]}]}, {"id": "e05de6b8-cc91-47d5-b269-1002bf6c1159", "type": "topic", "title": "Hematologic and Coagulation Disorders", "description": "Students learn care for anemia, bleeding, clotting, transfusion needs, and hematologic instability.", "children": [{"id": "f685bd37-26b2-4547-b4da-5edda7101dee", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Hematologic assessment", "description": "Students connect blood disorders to oxygen delivery, perfusion, bleeding, and infection risk.", "children": [{"id": "15003ead-fdf4-4a57-a5ac-1a2ebfd0fade", "type": "concept", "title": "CBC interpretation"}, {"id": "5b1e7543-0535-4788-9229-05bb0874cdbe", "type": "concept", "title": "Signs of anemia, thrombocytopenia, and neutropenia"}, {"id": "71310615-04f0-4ad3-89c0-346f90a57d29", "type": "concept", "title": "Bleeding, bruising, fatigue, and infection cues"}]}, {"id": "e2f8157b-e0fb-4c85-b9b4-8ab55b10f9e6", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Coagulation and clotting", "description": "This area is high risk because both bleeding and thrombosis can deteriorate quickly.", "children": [{"id": "d481ea38-c71a-44d8-81b3-af277ea99c87", "type": "concept", "title": "DVT/PE risk and prevention"}, {"id": "d80675dd-b3ee-407b-b15f-0e3ebe91f268", "type